        {
          "path": "_m/k/v/1/m/mulanje-massif-wp/magic-rock-along-the-road-to-m.jpg",
          "filename": "Magic rock along the road to Mulanje (15508370147).jpg",
          "caption": "The story goes that during construction of the road to Mulanje it took many men to move this large rock out of the way. In the morning they returned to find it back in its place. As there's strong magic associated with Mulanje mountain they left it where it was and built the road around the rock. Now people leave money and gifts to the spirit that protects this rock. I didn't want to take any chances so I left a small offering too.",
